			"notes": "Initial release of PearlCounter for Minecraft 1.21.11.\n\n### Features\n\n- Tracks how many ender pearls each player has thrown through color coded suffixes in the nametag\n- Optional pearl counter above the hotbar.\n- Configurable counter position, colors, separators, and reset behavior.\n- Supports the default pearl icon or resource-pack textures.\n- Optional Uku's TotemCounter integration with an alternating shared display.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader 0.17 or newer\n- Fabric API\n- Ukulib 1.10.x\n- Java 21\n\nTotemCounter 1.11.2 or newer is optional"
